{"name":"Hard mewing","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":12,"casual":{"lead":["Hard mewing is a stronger version of mewing: instead of lightly resting the tongue on the palate, the person presses upward with deliberate effort. People use it hoping for a wider, more defined lower face, a more forward midface and better breathing and posture.","The reasoning extends the orthotropic idea that tongue pressure guides upper-jaw growth, with firmer pressure expected to do more. Bone does adapt to strain in general, but no published study has measured what forceful tongue pressure does to the adult face. Forum users most often report wider masseter muscles and a changed look to the cheeks."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Users treat it as a step up from ordinary mewing, done in sessions or held through the day, and often combine it with chewing, chin tucks, thumb pulling or palate expanders. Reports of visible change in photos vary from weeks to years."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Forum users report enlarged masseters, altered cheek appearance, jaw or tongue fatigue, and a gap between the front teeth when combined with thumb pulling and expanders. These are anecdotal accounts; no clinical data exist on forceful tongue pressure, and orthodontic bodies note mewing in general has no supporting trials."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Hard mewing /mewing, hypertrophies/flares up masseters","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-mewing-hypertrophies-flares-up-masseters.1789136/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228024238/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-mewing-hypertrophies-flares-up-masseters.1789136/"},{"title":"Hard mewing and chin tucking saved my life.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-and-chin-tucking-saved-my-life.1396526/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250513132113/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-and-chin-tucking-saved-my-life.1396526/"},{"title":"JFL Hard Mewing + Chewing + Thumbpulling + Beltpulling + Bonesmashing + Chintucking","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-chewing-thumbpulling-beltpulling-bonesmashing-chintucking.389110/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220517021845/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-chewing-thumbpulling-beltpulling-bonesmashing-chintucking.389110/"},{"title":"hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing.3731/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250719061914/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing.3731/"},{"title":"what do yall think about hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-do-yall-think-about-hard-mewing.1413113/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250519114833/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-do-yall-think-about-hard-mewing.1413113/"},{"title":"1 year hard mewing progress","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/1-year-hard-mewing-progress.799033/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240213085527/https://looksmax.org/threads/1-year-hard-mewing-progress.799033/"},{"title":"what to do after gap between front teeth diastema from mse thumbpulling hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-to-do-after-gap-between-front-teeth-diastema-from-mse-thumbpulling-hard-mewing.557934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220830133141/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-to-do-after-gap-between-front-teeth-diastema-from-mse-thumbpulling-hard-mewing.557934/"},{"title":"why you should start hard mewing right now","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/why-you-should-start-hard-mewing-right-now.412325/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20211103023903/https://looksmax.org/threads/why-you-should-start-hard-mewing-right-now.412325/"},{"title":"stop hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/stop-hard-mewing.125349/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220809051326/https://looksmax.org/threads/stop-hard-mewing.125349/"},{"title":"mew pill my 5 year 24 7 hard mewing journey 100 proof jewing works mewcopers eternally btfo","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mew-pill-my-5-year-24-7-hard-mewing-journey-100-proof-jewing-works-mewcopers-eternally-btfo.13595/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250713203603/https://looksmax.org/threads/mew-pill-my-5-year-24-7-hard-mewing-journey-100-proof-jewing-works-mewcopers-eternally-btfo.13595/"},{"title":"mewing vs hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-vs-hard-mewing.8575/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250708120820/https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-vs-hard-mewing.8575/"},{"title":"mewing posture and hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-posture-and-hard-mewing.6546/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221007162733/https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-posture-and-hard-mewing.6546/"},{"title":"Westside/PLing Training Thread","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/westside-pling-training-thread/61964","site":"T Nation · 9775 posts · 2006"},{"title":"65+ Kicking and Screaming Toward 74+","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/65-kicking-and-screaming-toward-74/279218","site":"T Nation · 1212 posts · 2022"},{"title":"College Football 2011","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/college-football-2011/167942","site":"T Nation · 1127 posts · 2011"},{"title":"There's a Lot Wrong with Britain","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/theres-a-lot-wrong-with-britain/136315","site":"T Nation · 1126 posts · 2009"},{"title":"Romney vs. Santorum; It's ON!","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/romney-vs-santorum-its-on/174964","site":"T Nation · 661 posts · 2012"},{"title":"GOP Platform: A Better Way","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/gop-platform-a-better-way/219493","site":"T Nation · 627 posts · 2016"},{"title":"Radical positions","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/radical-positions/288879","site":"T Nation · 548 posts · 2024"},{"title":"Help TC Rock the Casbah","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/help-tc-rock-the-casbah/62875","site":"T Nation · 299 posts · 2006"},{"title":"The Hate Soccer Thread","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-hate-soccer-thread/66224","site":"T Nation · 218 posts · 2006"},{"title":"Book:  The God Delusion","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/book-the-god-delusion/75660","site":"T Nation · 136 posts · 2006"},{"title":"Pokemon on GameBoy","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/pokemon-on-gameboy/149729","site":"T Nation · 117 posts · 2010"},{"title":"Igniter Reviews","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/igniter-reviews/291743","site":"T Nation · 42 posts · 2025"},{"title":"The NFL is Letting Me Down","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-nfl-is-letting-me-down/116726","site":"T Nation · 39 posts · 2008"},{"title":"Faith Sharpens Faith (Talk, Prayer, Friendship, Interesting and Funny stuff)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/faith-sharpens-faith-talk-prayer-friendship-interesting-and-funny-stuff/247086","site":"T Nation · 39 posts · 2018"},{"title":"My A / B Full Body","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/my-a-b-full-body/180359","site":"T Nation · 33 posts · 2012"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Tokyo Mew Mew — Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Mew_Mew"},{"title":"Orthotropics (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orthotropics"},{"title":"Mewing (orthotropics) (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mewing_(orthotropics)"},{"title":"Masseter muscle (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseter_muscle"},{"title":"Palatal expansion (Wikipedia)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Jawline & face shape","chain":["Deliberate upward tongue pressure","Claimed bone or masseter change","Wider, more defined lower face"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Hard mewing is a forceful form of tongue posture used for faster jaw and midface definition, often alongside chewing, thumb pulling and expanders. Posters report wider masseters, which is a muscle change; bone change from tongue pressure has not been studied."},"wikipedia":{"title":"Tokyo Mew Mew","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokyo_Mew_Mew"},"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Hard mewing is a term used in looksmaxxing communities for a more forceful form of mewing, in which a person presses the tongue upward against the palate with deliberate effort rather than simply resting it there [1]. Forum users use it interchangeably with, or as a stage beyond, ordinary mewing, and some threads ask directly how the two differ [2].","Mewing derives from orthotropics, developed by British orthodontist John Mew, which claims that tongue posture guides facial growth. Professional orthodontic bodies do not support that claim, and the American Association of Orthodontists has stated there is no evidence that mewing improves the jaw [3]. No published research addresses hard mewing specifically."],"infobox":[["Type","Forceful tongue-posture practice"],["Parent practice","Mewing (orthotropics)"],["Commonly paired with","Chin tucks, chewing, thumb pulling, palate expansion"],["Professional position","Mewing: AAO states no evidence [3]"],["Evidence level","Unproven"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["In forum usage, hard mewing means pushing the tongue firmly into the roof of the mouth, sometimes while keeping the lips sealed and the teeth together, in contrast to a relaxed resting posture [2]. Some users describe doing it continuously during the day, often combined with chin tucks and other 'bonehacks' [4][5]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found. No clinical study has examined forceful tongue pressure on the palate for facial appearance. The wider topic of mewing and orthotropics has one small twin study of professionally delivered orthotropic treatment and a 2019 commentary, neither of which tests hard mewing."],"subs":[]},{"h":"In looksmaxxing culture","paras":["On looksmax.org, hard mewing is both promoted and disputed. One poster claimed it gave forward growth even after puberty when combined with chin tucks and sprinting, calling it more effective than drugs, while replies asked for photographic evidence [6]. Another thread describes a user who began hard mewing and noticed wider masseters, hollower cheeks and a harder time resting the teeth together, and asked whether an overbite was responsible [7]. A third user lists hard mewing, chewing, thumb pulling, belt pulling, bonesmashing and chin tucking as parts of a daily regimen [8]. A further thread asks what to do about a gap between the front teeth after palate expansion, thumb pulling and hard mewing [9].","The discussion shows the belief that more force means more effect, and an opposing view in other threads that it is unproven or counterproductive; one thread title urges members to stop hard mewing [10]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Hard mewing appears on looksmax.org as the intensive version of mewing, usually in routines with other bone-related practices [4][8].","claims":[{"claim":"Hard mewing causes forward growth even after puberty","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Hard mewing widens the jaw or enlarges the masseters","verdict":"unknown","note":""},{"claim":"Hard mewing combined with thumb pulling and expanders produces visible change","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Orthotropics","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Orthotropics","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Mewing vs hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-vs-hard-mewing.8575/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Mewing (orthotropics)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mewing_(orthotropics)","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Mewing posture and hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/mewing-posture-and-hard-mewing.6546/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing.3731/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hard mewing and chin tucking saved my life","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-and-chin-tucking-saved-my-life.1396526/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hard mewing / mewing hypertrophies / flares up masseters","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-mewing-hypertrophies-flares-up-masseters.1789136/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Hard Mewing + Chewing + Thumbpulling + Beltpulling + Bonesmashing + Chintucking","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-chewing-thumbpulling-beltpulling-bonesmashing-chintucking.389110/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"What to do after gap between front teeth (diastema) from MSE, thumbpulling, hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-to-do-after-gap-between-front-teeth-diastema-from-mse-thumbpulling-hard-mewing.557934/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Stop hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/stop-hard-mewing.125349/","source":"looksmax.org","year":null,"type":"forum"},{"title":"Masseter muscle","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Masseter_muscle","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Palatal expansion","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palatal_expansion","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"Hard mewing /mewing, hypertrophies/flares up masseters","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-mewing-hypertrophies-flares-up-masseters.1789136/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228024238/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-mewing-hypertrophies-flares-up-masseters.1789136/"},{"title":"Hard mewing and chin tucking saved my life.","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-and-chin-tucking-saved-my-life.1396526/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250513132113/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-and-chin-tucking-saved-my-life.1396526/"},{"title":"JFL Hard Mewing + Chewing + Thumbpulling + Beltpulling + Bonesmashing + Chintucking","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-chewing-thumbpulling-beltpulling-bonesmashing-chintucking.389110/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220517021845/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing-chewing-thumbpulling-beltpulling-bonesmashing-chintucking.389110/"},{"title":"hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing.3731/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250719061914/https://looksmax.org/threads/hard-mewing.3731/"},{"title":"what do yall think about hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-do-yall-think-about-hard-mewing.1413113/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250519114833/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-do-yall-think-about-hard-mewing.1413113/"},{"title":"1 year hard mewing progress","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/1-year-hard-mewing-progress.799033/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240213085527/https://looksmax.org/threads/1-year-hard-mewing-progress.799033/"},{"title":"what to do after gap between front teeth diastema from mse thumbpulling hard mewing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-to-do-after-gap-between-front-teeth-diastema-from-mse-thumbpulling-hard-mewing.557934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220830133141/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-to-do-after-gap-between-front-teeth-diastema-from-mse-thumbpulling-hard-mewing.557934/"},{"title":"why you should start hard mewing right now","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/why-you-should-start-hard-mewing-right-now.412325/","site":"looksmax.org","archive